rd-94b9e9de3c: full ledger export\n48: Recorded: 2026-08-25. Cohort: new Android accounts in Canada.\n49: Reference: support/record-94b9e9de3c; responsibility: routine-quality. Environment: production.\n50: The release was staged for the next train. The merge notification does not include a production rollout receipt. Owner: Lea.\n51: Follow-up: compare the next weekly interview notes before interpreting full ledger export as a broader change.\n52: \n53: ## record-692c321fe0: workspace dump\n54: Recorded: 2026-08-26. Cohort: returning desktop teams in Germany.\n55: Reference: support/record-692c321fe0; responsibility: routine-quality. Environment: production.\n56: Three interviewees preferred the shorter wording; two asked for the existing wording. The interviews did not establish behavior outside this cohort. Owner: Mina.\n57: Follow-up: compare the next five recordings before interpreting workspace dump as a broader change.\n58: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
